					<![CDATA[
						 <p>3Ports is allowed little a car, as a treat.</p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">A&nbsp;Theoretical&nbsp;Sequel</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">A&nbsp;Theoretical&nbsp;Sequel</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>&quot;Agent?&quot;</p> <p>&quot;Yes, sir?&quot;</p> <p>&quot;What am I looking at?&quot;</p> <p>&quot;It appears to be a three-car pileup, sir.&quot;</p> <p>&quot;Jesus Christ.&quot;</p> <p>&quot;It gets worst, sir.&quot;</p> <p>&quot;How could it-&quot;</p> <p><strong>&quot;Hey there friends! The name's Joey, Joey Fucknuts!&quot;</strong></p> <p>&quot;What the fuck.&quot;</p> <p>&quot;I told you, sir.&quot;</p> </div> </div> </div> 
				 	]]>
